# Build context for infra/docker/Dockerfile.* (context = repo root). Keeps local deps, caches and
# secrets out of images and makes laptop builds fast.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.local-storage
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
